and Verified +1 before Submit; ticket close stays blocked on that landing."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788732948591991294,"uuid":"5c5a6c64-3c15-4c59-9f71-28901819f178"}